MSAL for HarmonyOS (Community Edition)

This is an independent community implementation of an OAuth 2.0 / OpenID
Connect public-client SDK for HarmonyOS. It is not an official Microsoft
product and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Microsoft
Corporation.

Microsoft, Microsoft Entra, MSAL, and related marks are trademarks of
Microsoft Corporation. This project contains no Microsoft source code.

The project's OAuth/OIDC behavior and public API concepts are informed by the
open-source MSAL iOS/macOS project:
https://github.com/AzureAD/microsoft-authentication-library-for-objc
